 "description": "EN port of PL 2026-10-21 five-screens pixel-verified UI fixes (ui-five-screens-2026-10-21), limited to technical fit/slot fixes EN shares with PL: (1) Bind weapon-trait lines shortened below the [TGT Wr.] clearance (EN was 46-47 cells, PL-final 36-37) keeping the exact control-token sequence; (2) all weapon-trait tag cells gained the space between trait name and %sN token that PL inserted ('<Bind%s1>' -> '<Bind %s1>'), +1 cell, no overflow; (3) Coord. Atk rows drop 'units' and 'Shown Atk' -> 'Atk = group total', Stun rows drop 'extra', Detonate drops 'to foes', to approach the PL-final width; (4) sysmes help-bar and status-banner rows exceeding the JP-layout-verified slot widths (<=32/36/38/40/47/6/7 cells) were shortened or re-wrapped to fit, preserving line count and tokens; (5) the Forecast-PBP executable labels 0x08bf828c..0x08bf82d8 shortened to the verified pixel slots, mirroring PL ('A/H', 'Sur.', 'Link Atk', 'Full', 'Pin', 'Lone'); (6) battle top-bar 'Action Cmds' (11 cells) shortened to 'Actions' (7 cells, <=JP 12), mirroring PL 'Akcje'; (7) Slow weapon-trait lines drop 'foe ' (1 turn, Eva-NN%; 30/31 cells = JP, <=PL-final 33/34); (8) sysmes 10096 Captured stat banner rewritten compact (22 cells = PL-final, <=JP 24): A/H/E, CritT. Not ported: cosmetic PL-only rewordings with no slot overflow (all other trait lines are <=37 cells and clear the area), the '%s NN%%' penalty-spacing cosmetic (would exceed the PL-final width where it matters), and rows already within the verified bound are left wordy rather than gutted (see ledger exceptions).",
